"Corrigido o zoom da WebView que estava ativado por padrão (agora desativado)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:184
msgid ""
"Fixed WhatsApp loading in mobile layout on HiDPI displays until resized; the "
"prewarm viewport is now sized in physical pixels (#176)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:716
msgid "Fixed WhatsApp notification permission not persisting across sessions"
msgstr ""
"Corrigida a permissão de notificação do WhatsApp que não persistia entre "
"sessões"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:212
msgid ""
"Fixed a black chat area on NVIDIA drivers by falling back to software "
"rendering where the accelerated path cannot deliver frames. (#167)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:226
msgid ""
"Fixed a black/blank window on GNOME OS and other newer Wayland setups by "
"switching to GTK's GL renderer, which presents the CEF browser view "
"correctly where the default Vulkan renderer could not. (#164)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:662
msgid "Fixed application freeze during lifecycle events"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o congelamento do aplicativo durante eventos do ciclo de vida"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:477
msgid ""
"Fixed application freezing on resume by reverting aggressive cache "
"optimization"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o congelamento do aplicativo ao retomar, revertendo a otimização "
"agressiva de cache"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:614
msgid "Fixed autostart toggle pathing for Flatpak environments"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o caminho do alternador de inicialização automática para ambientes "
"Flatpak"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:488
msgid "Fixed background notifications reliability"
msgstr "Melhorada a confiabilidade das notificações em segundo plano"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:478
msgid "Fixed background validation to ensure app starts correctly"
msgstr ""
"Corrigida a validação em segundo plano para garantir que o aplicativo inicie "
"corretamente"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:174
msgid ""
"Fixed blank view on GLES-only devices such as the PinePhone: the render area "
"now negotiates its required GLES 3.0 context and software rendering resumes "
"automatically when accelerated frames are unavailable (#177)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:375
msgid "Fixed blob URL downloads (e.g. Save Image from the media viewer)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigidos os downloads de URL blob (por exemplo, Salvar imagem no "
"visualizador de mídia)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:149
msgid "Fixed characters being dropped right after sending a message (#180)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:157
msgid "Fixed characters occasionally being dropped while typing (#180)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:175
msgid ""
"Fixed chat text selection and copying: drag-select, immediate Ctrl+C and "
"right-click → Copy now read the live selection without racing the PRIMARY "
"clipboard (#178)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:719
msgid "Fixed clipboard manager intercepting all paste events"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o gerenciador da área de transferência que interceptava todos os "
"eventos de colagem"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:387
msgid "Fixed crash on launch due to memory pressure threshold ordering"
msgstr ""
"Corrigida a falha ao iniciar devido à ordenação do limite de pressão de "
"memória"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:873
msgid "Fixed crash when handling invalid notification data"
msgstr "Corrigida a falha ao tratar dados inválidos de notificação"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:839
msgid "Fixed crash when handling invalid user input data"
msgstr "Corrigida a falha ao tratar dados inválidos de entrada do usuário"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:639
msgid ""
"Fixed critical startup freeze (spinner) issue by implementing D-Bus "
"activation"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o congelamento crítico na inicialização (indicador giratório) "
"implementando a ativação por D-Bus"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:389
msgid "Fixed dead key composition for first character in input fields"
msgstr ""
"Corrigida a composição de teclas mortas para o primeiro caractere em campos "
"de entrada"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:210
msgid ""
"Fixed dead-key accents (e.g. US Intl) intermittently typing the plain letter "
"after sending a message; the input method is re-focused on the next "
"keypress. (#154)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:539
msgid "Fixed double-paste issue with middle-click"
msgstr "Corrigido o problema de colagem dupla com o botão do meio"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:388
msgid "Fixed download destination and context menu issues"
msgstr "Corrigidos problemas no destino de download e no menu de contexto"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:397
msgid "Fixed download destination handling"
msgstr "Corrigido o tratamento do destino de download"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:355
msgid "Fixed download filenames now use WhatsApp's original filename"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: os nomes de arquivos baixados agora usam o nome de arquivo "
"original do WhatsApp"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:108
msgid "Fixed drags being refused as they entered the window on some desktops."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:356
msgid "Fixed duplicate downloads auto-increment instead of failing"
msgstr "Corrigido: downloads duplicados são autoincrementados em vez de falhar"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:856
msgid "Fixed duplicate provides tags in metainfo validation"
msgstr "Corrigidas as tags provides duplicadas na validação do metainfo"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:173
msgid ""
"Fixed engine-drawn popups being anchored to a degenerate window origin on "
"X11 multi-monitor setups; the real window position is now used (#158)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:783
msgid ""
"Fixed external links not opening in default browser when running in Flatpak"
msgstr ""
"Corrigidos os links externos que não abriam no navegador padrão ao executar "
"no Flatpak"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:120
msgid ""
"Fixed files dragged into the window not attaching; the same problem affected "
"pasting a file copied in a file manager (#192)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:386
msgid "Fixed freezes when viewing media galleries"
msgstr "Corrigidos os congelamentos ao visualizar galerias de mídia"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:786
msgid "Fixed invalid meson version requirement preventing builds"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o requisito de versão inválido do meson que impedia as builds"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:109
msgid ""
"Fixed letters being dropped when a key was pressed while Backspace, Enter or "
"an arrow key was still held (#180)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:546
msgid "Fixed missing GSettings schema in Flatpak builds"
msgstr "Corrigido o esquema GSettings ausente nas builds do Flatpak"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:661
msgid "Fixed missing dictionaries on startup"
msgstr "Corrigidos os dicionários ausentes na inicialização"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:604
msgid ""
"Fixed missing tray icon on GNOME by adding StatusNotifierWatcher permission"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o ícone da bandeja ausente no GNOME adicionando a permissão "
"StatusNotifierWatcher"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:165
msgid ""
"Fixed mouse clicks landing slightly above and to the left of the pointer: "
"clicks were offset by the header bar and window shadow, so buttons and chats "
"often did not activate where you clicked."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:358
msgid "Fixed notification sounds now respect GNOME volume controls"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: os sons de notificação agora respeitam os controles de volume do "
"GNOME"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:717
msgid "Fixed notifications banner appearing on every app launch"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o banner de notificações que aparecia a cada inicialização do "
"aplicativo"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:374
msgid ""
"Fixed on-screen keyboard not appearing reliably on Phosh and touch-based "
"Linux environments"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o teclado virtual que não aparecia de forma confiável no Phosh e "
"em ambientes Linux com toque"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:110
msgid "Fixed pasting a text file inserting nothing."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:172
msgid ""
"Fixed pointer misalignment on HiDPI / mixed-scale desktops: clicks, "
"scrolling and context menus are now pixel-accurate, and the page zoom re-"
"syncs when moving windows between monitors with different scales (#158)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:764
msgid "Fixed potential rendering inconsistencies"
msgstr "Corrigidas possíveis inconsistências de renderização"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:785
msgid "Fixed random emoji display issues and blank emoji problems"
msgstr ""
"Corrigidos problemas aleatórios de exibição de emojis e emojis em branco"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:147
msgid ""
"Fixed right-click Paste ignoring text, images and files copied from other "
"applications (#189)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:135
msgid ""
"Fixed scrolling still stalling with software rendering: frames were held up "
"by the browser engine's event loop and only released by a fallback timer, "
"redrawing the window about 10 times a second instead of 60 (#173, #179)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:430
msgid "Fixed startup race conditions and resource usage issues"
msgstr ""
"Corrigidas condições de corrida na inicialização e problemas de uso de "
"recursos"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:145
msgid ""
"Fixed stuttery scrolling and typing lag: frames no longer wait on a poll "
"timer and are no longer dropped, on software and GPU rendering alike (#173, "
"#179)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:219
msgid ""
"Fixed the GNOME OS / Wayland black window for real (#164): CEF was racing to "
"the X11 Ozone backend and failing to present onto the Wayland view; Karere "
"now forces CEF's Ozone backend to match the display server, so it no longer "
"intermittently starts black."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:148
msgid ""
"Fixed the message menu \"Copy\" not reaching the system clipboard (#178)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:146
msgid "Fixed the microphone staying muted in calls (#182)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:227
msgid ""
"Fixed the mobile layout dropping the message box focus when pressing Enter "
"on a computer; focus is now kept on non-touch devices while phones still "
"hide the keyboard after sending."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:209
msgid ""
"Fixed touchpad scrolling being ~5x too slow with a delay before it started; "
"deltas are now scaled the same way Chromium's own Wayland backend scales "
"them. (#161)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:202
msgid ""
"Fixed touchpad scrolling sometimes needing a click in a pane before it "
"responded; scrolling now targets the pane under the pointer like every other "
"app. (#161)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:615
msgid "Fixed tray icon quit behavior"
msgstr "Corrigido o comportamento de saída pelo ícone da bandeja"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:468
msgid "Fixed tray icons on KDE/GNOME (visible on both light/dark themes)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigidos os ícones da bandeja no KDE/GNOME (visíveis em temas claros e "
"escuros)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:183
msgid ""
"Fixed tray “Quit” doing nothing while the window is hidden (e.g. Start in "
"background) (#175)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:340
msgid ""
"Fixed voice and video calls in production Flatpak (Flathub linter-compatible "
"pre-built plugin)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigidas as chamadas de voz e vídeo no Flatpak de produção (plugin pré-"
"compilado compatível com o linter do Flathub)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:347
msgid ""
"Fixed voice and video calls not working in the production build (missing "
"noise suppression plugin)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigidas as chamadas de voz e vídeo que não funcionavam na build de "
"produção (plugin de supressão de ruído ausente)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:373
msgid ""
"Fixed voice and video calls showing \"Your browser doesn't support calling\""
msgstr ""
"Corrigidas as chamadas de voz e vídeo que mostravam \"Seu navegador não "
"suporta chamadas\""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:357
msgid ""
"Fixed window now properly unminimizes when activated from launcher or tray"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: a janela agora restaura corretamente quando ativada pelo lançador "
"ou pela bandeja"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:487
msgid "Fixed window resize behavior to prevent excessive reloading"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido o comportamento de redimensionamento da janela para evitar "
"recargas excessivas"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:438
msgid "Fixed window size increasing on every restart"
msgstr "Corrigido o aumento do tamanho da janela a cada reinício"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:503
msgid "Fixed zombie process accumulation"
msgstr "Corrigido o acúmulo de processos zumbis"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:186
msgid ""
"Fixed “Match WhatsApp Colors” applying only after restart; it now updates "
"live when toggled (#168)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:637
msgid "Fixed:"
msgstr "Corrigido:"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:460
msgid ""
"Fixed: App now respects system \"Do Not Disturb\" settings on GNOME "
"(silences sounds)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: o aplicativo agora respeita as configurações \"Não perturbe\" do "
"sistema no GNOME (silencia os sons)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:405
msgid "Fixed: Download destination path handling regression"
msgstr "Corrigido: regressão no tratamento do caminho de destino de download"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:419
msgid ""
"Fixed: Handle WebKit web process crashes with auto-reload and user "
"notification"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: tratamento de falhas do processo web do WebKit com recarga "
"automática e notificação ao usuário"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:420
msgid "Fixed: JS injection and path traversal vulnerabilities"
msgstr "Corrigido: vulnerabilidades de injeção de JS e travessia de caminho"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:412
msgid ""
"Fixed: JS injection and path traversal vulnerabilities in download handling"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: vulnerabilidades de injeção de JS e travessia de caminho no "
"tratamento de downloads"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:461
msgid "Fixed: Notifications bypass DND visuals (priority lowered to Normal)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: as notificações ignoram os recursos visuais do modo Não perturbe "
"(prioridade reduzida para Normal)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:421
msgid "Fixed: Panic in notification handling"
msgstr "Corrigido: pânico no tratamento de notificações"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:445
msgid ""
"Fixed: Resolved webview reload loop on startup due to incorrect window size "
"detection"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: resolvido o loop de recarga da webview na inicialização devido à "
"detecção incorreta do tamanho da janela"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:294
msgid ""
"Fixed: accented characters from dead keys (e.g. the US-International layout) "
"now compose correctly instead of inserting the base letter — input is routed "
"through the system input method (#154)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:329
msgid ""
"Fixed: app crash on launch on GNOME 50 / glibc 2.42+ systems (Arch, Fedora "
"43, CachyOS, Bazzite, postmarketOS)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: falha do aplicativo ao iniciar em sistemas GNOME 50 / glibc 2.42+ "
"(Arch, Fedora 43, CachyOS, Bazzite, postmarketOS)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:319
msgid ""
"Fixed: blank-window race when autostarted before the network/portal stack is "
"ready (auto-retry with exponential backoff)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: condição de corrida de janela em branco quando iniciado "
"automaticamente antes de a rede/pilha de portais estar pronta (nova "
"tentativa automática com recuo exponencial)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:332
msgid ""
"Fixed: downloaded files with duplicate names silently overwriting each other "
"(now appends (1), (2), ...)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: arquivos baixados com nomes duplicados sobrescrevendo uns aos "
"outros silenciosamente (agora acrescenta (1), (2), ...)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:249
msgid ""
"Fixed: input-method candidate popups (e.g. ibus-libpinyin) appeared in the "
"top-left corner; they now show by the chat input where you click (#163)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:318
msgid ""
"Fixed: lingering notification badges/banners after focus on GNOME 50 (auto-"
"clear behavior removed upstream — Karere now dismisses notifications "
"explicitly)"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: selos/avisos de notificação persistentes após o foco no GNOME 50 "
"(comportamento de limpeza automática removido do upstream — o Karere agora "
"dispensa as notificações explicitamente)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:330
msgid ""
"Fixed: locale-dependent crash that required manually setting "
"LC_ALL=en_GB.UTF-8"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: falha dependente da localidade que exigia definir manualmente "
"LC_ALL=en_GB.UTF-8"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:331
msgid "Fixed: mobile layout broken by recent WhatsApp Web DOM changes"
msgstr ""
"Corrigido: layout móvel quebrado por mudanças recentes no DOM do WhatsApp Web"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:241
msgid ""
"Fixed: on Phosh / GNOME Mobile the on-screen keyboard stayed open all the "
"time; it now follows the focused WhatsApp text field, appearing when you tap "
"a message or search box and hiding otherwise"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:248
msgid ""
"Fixed: sluggish touchpad scrolling — disabled Chromium's smooth-scroll "
"animation for instant, responsive scrolling (#161)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:256
msgid ""
"Fixed: the ARM64 (aarch64) build, which had been failing since 4.0.4 due to "
"a type error in the GPU-rendering code — so this is the first release to "
"reach ARM64 (Phosh / mobile) users with the recent fixes, including touch "
"scrolling (#162)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:278
msgid ""
"Fixed: the selected theme is now applied from startup, including when the "
"app launches into the background at login — the window no longer opens light "
"when dark is selected. WhatsApp Web content also follows the theme now (when "
"WhatsApp's own theme is set to System default) (#160)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:286
msgid ""
"Fixed: the web view is now crisp under fractional/HiDPI display scaling "
"(e.g. 150%/200% on GNOME Wayland) — the page is rendered to match the "
"window's pixel buffer exactly instead of being upscaled, while staying at "
"the correct size (#158)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:264
msgid ""
"Fixed: touch scrolling and tapping in the chat view on touchscreens (e.g. "
"Phosh / mobile Linux) — touch input is now forwarded to the web view as "
"native touch events (#162)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:279
msgid ""
"Fixed: typing in the narrow/mobile layout no longer inserts a stray space "
"after the first letter (#159)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:287
msgid ""
"Fixed: typing the first letter of a message no longer inserts a stray space "
"after it (a 4.0.1 input regression) (#154)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:295
msgid ""
"Fixed: web content is now sized correctly under fractional display scaling "
"such as 150%; the view and input use logical coordinates with the fractional "
"scale applied for crisp rendering (#155, #156)"
msgstr ""

